\\ Simulate energy accumulation for GURPS Ritual Path Magic
\\ (TODO: handle critical hits)

\\ Zero page usage:
\\   00: Skill
\\   01: Energy required *
\\   03: Critical miss threshold
\\   04: Time *
\\   06: Energy acquired *
\\   08: Quirks

|0100
  DUP2k EOR2 STH2k
  ;RandomExt #02 DEO2
  #c1 DEI2 #c3 DEI2 EOR2 INC ;random/x STA2
  #c5 DEI2 #c7 DEI2 ADD2 INC ;random/y STA2
  reseed reseed POP2
\\ Read skill number (cannot exceed 128)
  #17 DEI [? show "Skill? 2000 ]@
  [; #10 DEO2 BRK ]@
  #0a12 DEI EQU [? #0a MUL #d012 DEI ADD ADD BRK ]@
  OVR STZk NIP
\\ Read energy number
  #0117 DEI LTH [? show "Energy? 2000 ]@
  [; #10 DEO2 BRK ]@
  #0a12 DEI EQU [? #000a MUL2 STHrk #d012 DEI ADD ADD2 BRK ]@
  #01 STZ2
\\ Secondary stack now has 00 00
  STH2rk

@main
\\ Calculate the number needed for a critical miss
\\ If x is effective skill number, then: min(x+10,max(x+2,17),18)
  LDZk #0a ADD #12 LTHk JMP SWP POP
  LDZrk STHr INC INC #11 GTHk JMP SWP POP
  LTHk JMP SWP POP #03 STZ
\\ Three tries
  try try try
\\ Decrement and loop
  LDZk #01 SUB OVR STZ !main

@show
  STH2r [@ LDAk #18 DEO INC2 LDAk ]? INC2 JMP2

@RandomExt
  03 f0
  4105 259c e061 11f0 963f 0026 1874 5416
  $1 00 10 =random

@number
  LITr 00
  [@ STH2 LIT2r 000a DIV2rk STH2rk MUL2r SUB2r NIPr LITr 30 ADDr ORAk ]?
  [@ LITr 18 DEOr STHrk ]?
  POPr #0a18 DEO JMP2r

\_ff'@+8>8<! ( alignment )
@Dice
  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
  03 04 05 06 07 08 04 05 06 07 08 09 05 06 07 08
  09 0a 06 07 08 09 0a 0b 07 08 09 0a 0b 0c 08 09
  0a 0b 0c 0d 04 05 06 07 08 09 05 06 07 08 09 0a
  06 07 08 09 0a 0b 07 08 09 0a 0b 0c 08 09 0a 0b
  0c 0d 09 0a 0b 0c 0d 0e 05 06 07 08 09 0a 06 07
  08 09 0a 0b 07 08 09 0a 0b 0c 08 09 0a 0b 0c 0d
  09 0a 0b 0c 0d 0e 0a 0b 0c 0d 0e 0f 06 07 08 09
  0a 0b 07 08 09 0a 0b 0c 08 09 0a 0b 0c 0d 09 0a
  0b 0c 0d 0e 0a 0b 0c 0d 0e 0f 0b 0c 0d 0e 0f 10
  07 08 09 0a 0b 0c 08 09 0a 0b 0c 0d 09 0a 0b 0c
  0d 0e 0a 0b 0c 0d 0e 0f 0b 0c 0d 0e 0f 10 0c 0d
  0e 0f 10 11 08 09 0a 0b 0c 0d 09 0a 0b 0c 0d 0e
  0a 0b 0c 0d 0e 0f 0b 0c 0d 0e 0f 10 0c 0d 0e 0f
  10 11 0d 0e 0f 10 11 12 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00

@reseed
  [& random POP2 ]@
@random ( -- number )
  ,&x LDR2
  DUP2 #50 SFT2 EOR2
  DUP2 #03 SFT2 EOR2
  ,&y LDR2 DUP2 ,&x STR2
  DUP2 #01 SFT2 EOR2 EOR2
  ,&y STR2k POP ADD JMP2r
  &x 0001 &y 0001

@try
  #04 LDZ2k INC2 ROT STZ2
  LIT \:Dice \_8>w random LDA
  DUP [? POP !try ]@
  DUP #03 LDZ LTH [? show "Botched. 0a00 !done ]@
  OVR LDZ SWP SUB EQUk ADD
  DUP #80 LTH [? POP EQUk #08 LDZk INC SWP STZ ]@
  LITr 06 LDZ2rk STH2 DUP ADD2r STH2rk ROTr STZ2r
  #01 LDZ2 LTH2 STH2r JCN2
  show "OK 0a00
@done
  show "Energy: 2000 #06 LDZ2 number
  show "Time: 2000 #04 LDZ2 number
  show "Quirks: 2000 #0008 LDZ number
  #800f DEO BRK
